usage: harnessix [-h]
                 {model-smoke,coding-eval-campaign,coding-eval-suite,agent,code,agent-server,config,state,license}
                 ...

Harnessix Code

positional arguments:
  {model-smoke,coding-eval-campaign,coding-eval-suite,agent,code,agent-server,config,state,license}
    model-smoke         运行显式启用的固定场景模型验收
    coding-eval-campaign
                        运行显式启用的固定历史任务真实模型Campaign
    coding-eval-suite   运行显式启用的固定Task Pack真实Provider Suite
    agent               通过stdio App Server运行薄Agent CLI
    code                启动全屏Coding Agent终端产品
    agent-server        按产品配置运行stdio App Server
    config              诊断或迁移产品配置
    state               停机备份并验证完整产品状态
    license             显示社区许可证、源代码和商业许可信息

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
